ion in telecom cables, along with specialty additive, black, and white masterbatches for polymer products. For industrial pipeline coating applications, the company manufactures high-density polyethylene top coat compounds for the outer layer of three-layer polyethylene pipeline coating systems used on oil, gas, and water distribution pipelines, and polypropylene top coat compounds for three-layer polypropylene pipeline coating applications. It also manufactures adhesive compounds, which serve as intermediate layer adhesives for bonding between the fusion bonded epoxy base layer and the top coat layer in three-layer pipeline coating systems. Additionally, the company trades polymers and operates as a stockist and distributor of polymer products. BLS Polymers Limited was incorporated in 1991 and is based in New Delhi, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795774497},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774497,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"BLS Polymers\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"BLS POLYMERS LIMITED Share Price","s":"Upstox","d":1795727591,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE13Z3pWTjFzMm5IWGVoQTBNczAyRFhSd3J5a2NfZW0wZVZONGZDMkVaRklxVVQtQ1JibnFJMThkNmRzZFdXNk8wTzJkZS1JaFBiMDF1NUVQYmhqOVZxVUZNZ3RVbnNyMzI5TTl3?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"BLS Polymers Limited (BLSPOLY.NS) stock price, news, quote and history","s":"Yahoo Finance Singapore","d":1795613333,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBaMkJVQWM5NGV4aXNrdVJGd3pVNS1ORnc1cUdwd2NTQmI4RG9IWmpNZHFEZmVfdV9BcUw4QmdxZnpZWmNIaFMzRFpvRFhMN0MtT3FkaVQ0SmJJQQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"BLS Polymers eyes 15% EBITDA margin expansion post-listing","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795412905,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNUnF3b0pZLXpwa3p2TlFBQ2tCMXhhN1JPTzhPeGk5NmxiMlE3OHc1NmNUZlY5bXhyaVdlaF9CMTJLUTJ4Ukk4UmRUZnZseUphQlFhRnNqeFJSanBoTTRhUGJ5bjFTRWdIVEJ5X2NYT3Vuc1NOM1kwRnl4U2FEZ19Wd